<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's NLCF buys 52,000T Argentine corn - trader.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's NLCF buys 52,000T Argentine corn - trader.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's state-run National Livestock Cooperative Federation bought 52,000 tonnes of Argentine corn on Wednesday, a trader said on Friday.  </p>
<p>In the first seven months of this year, South Korea imported a total of 52,000 tonnes of Argentine corn, an official with the Ministry of Agriculture and Forestry said. Imports from the South American country in 1995 were just 26,000 tonnes.</p>
</text>
